<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<title>NoFilter · Workplace Coffee Agreement · Singapore</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@700;800;900&amp;family=Anton&amp;family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
/* =====================================================================
   NoFilter — Supply Agreement
   A4 print fidelity. Hard corners. Linear motion. No softness.
   ===================================================================== */

:root {
  --nf-near-black: #2A2B2A;
  --nf-orange:     #FF7122;
  --nf-stamp-red:  #FA2B1C;
  --nf-amber-dim:  #FFE8C3;
  --nf-cream:      #F4F0E6;
  --nf-cream-deep: #ECE6D6;
  --nf-rule-dark:  rgba(255,232,195,0.16);
  --nf-rule-light: #2A2B2A;

  --font-display: "Big Shoulders Display", "Founders Grotesk Condensed", "Trade Gothic Bold Condensed No. 2", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  --font-poster:  "Anton", "Big Shoulders Display", sans-serif;
  --font-body:    "Archivo", "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-mono:    "IBM Plex Mono", "SF Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;

  /* ============== TUNABLE — wired to live editor sliders ============== */
  --tune-body-size:        9pt;     /* global body text */
  --tune-body-line:        1.5;     /* line height */
  --tune-page-padding:     14mm;    /* page edge margins */
  --tune-block-gap:        7mm;     /* vertical gap between blocks */
  --tune-cover-title:      46pt;    /* SUPPLY AGREEMENT 2026/29 */
  --tune-cover-logo-w:     75%;     /* logo width on cover */
  --tune-cover-photo-y:    35%;     /* photo focal point Y */
  --tune-cover-grad-top:   0.45;    /* gradient opacity at top */
  --tune-cover-grad-mid:   0.10;    /* gradient opacity at middle */
  --tune-cover-grad-bot:   0.82;    /* gradient opacity at bottom */
  --tune-section-h:        32pt;    /* "TWO PARTIES" / "ONE MACHINE" headlines */
  --tune-relief-num:       72pt;    /* "01" / "A" / "B" big numerals */
  --tune-numeral-gap:      12mm;    /* gap between numeral col and body */
  --tune-clause-size:      9pt;     /* clause body text on terms page */
  --tune-clause-title:     12pt;    /* clause headers */
  --tune-clause-row-gap:   4mm;     /* vertical gap between clauses */
  --tune-lots-row-pad:     8px;     /* lots-table row vertical padding */
  --tune-lots-lot-size:    14pt;    /* lots-table lot id text */
  --tune-stats-num:        28pt;    /* origin page stat numbers */
  --tune-impact-h:         36pt;    /* "WHERE THE COFFEE..." headline */
}

/* -------------------- Reset -------------------- */
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body { background: #1A1A1A; }
body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--tune-body-size);
  line-height: var(--tune-body-line);
  color: var(--nf-near-black);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  padding: 36px 0;
}
img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

/* -------------------- Page (A4) -------------------- */
.page {
  width: 210mm;
  height: 297mm;
  margin: 0 auto 24px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  page-break-after: always;
  break-after: page;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; break-after: auto; }

.page--dark  { background: var(--nf-near-black); color: var(--nf-amber-dim); }
.page--cream { background: var(--nf-cream);      color: var(--nf-near-black); }

/* Grain overlay — only on flat colour fields */
.grain { position: relative; isolation: isolate; }
.grain::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.07; mix-blend-mode: overlay;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='160' height='160'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.92' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
}

/* -------------------- Page chrome (header + footer rails) --------------------
   Rails are flow-positioned (not absolute). They take real height and content
   can never overlap them. Top rail sits at the top, bottom rail at the bottom
   (pushed down by margin-top:auto on the rail itself or flex:1 on content). */
.rail {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin: 0 14mm;
  padding: 5mm 0 4mm;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 5;
}
.rail--top    { padding: 5mm 0 0; }
.rail--bottom {
  margin-top: auto; /* pin to bottom of flex column */
  padding: 4mm 0 5mm;
  position: relative;
}
.rail--bottom::before {
  content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
  height: 1px; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.35;
}
.page--dark  .rail { color: var(--nf-amber-dim); opacity: 0.7; }
.page--cream .rail { color: var(--nf-near-black); opacity: 0.55; }
.page--cover .rail { z-index: 5; } /* on top of bg photo */
.rail .orange { color: var(--nf-orange); opacity: 1; }

.rail__group { display: flex; gap: 18px; }

/* -------------------- Generic display type -------------------- */
.label {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  font-size: 8pt;
  color: var(--nf-orange);
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 01 — COVER
   Documentary cover: harvest photo as atmospheric background, dark gradient
   overlay for legibility, logo at restrained scale (no longer bleed-sized),
   stamps + meta layered on top.
   ===================================================================== */
.page--cover {
  background: var(--nf-near-black);
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
}
.page--cover .cover__bg {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.page--cover .cover__bg img {
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover; object-position: 40% var(--tune-cover-photo-y);
  display: block;
}
/* Dark gradient overlay — light at top so the photo is visible behind logo,
   heavy at bottom for title block readability. */
.page--cover .cover__bg::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg,
      rgba(42,43,42,var(--tune-cover-grad-top)) 0%,
      rgba(42,43,42,calc(var(--tune-cover-grad-top) * 0.4)) 18%,
      rgba(42,43,42,var(--tune-cover-grad-mid)) 50%,
      rgba(42,43,42,calc(var(--tune-cover-grad-bot) * 0.85)) 78%,
      rgba(42,43,42,var(--tune-cover-grad-bot)) 100%);
}
/* Grain on top of everything */
.page--cover::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.10; mix-blend-mode: overlay;
  z-index: 2;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='160' height='160'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.92' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
}

.cover {
  padding: var(--tune-page-padding);
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.cover__head {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24px;
}
.cover__head .stamp {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--nf-orange); color: var(--nf-orange);
  padding: 5px 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
  background: rgba(42,43,42,0.6); /* readability over photo */
  backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
}
.cover__head .stamp .dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--nf-orange);
}

/* Logo — restrained scale; sits in the upper third over darkest part of overlay */
.cover__logo {
  margin-top: 14mm;
  width: var(--tune-cover-logo-w);
}
.cover__logo img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

.cover__sub {
  margin-top: auto; /* pushed to bottom of page now that we have a photo */
  margin-bottom: 4mm;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
  gap: 28px;
}
.cover__sub > * { min-width: 0; } /* FIX: let grid cols honour fr shares; long titles/tokens no longer clip the meta-block */
.cover__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-cover-title);
  line-height: 0.9;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
  overflow-wrap: anywhere; /* FIX: long single-word client names wrap instead of overflowing the column */
}
.cover__title em {
  font-style: normal; color: var(--nf-orange);
}
.cover__meta-block {
  align-self: end;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--nf-orange); /* FIX: was rule-dark, now hard orange — anchors the block */
  padding-left: 14px;
}
.cover__meta-block .row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 78px 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.cover__meta-block .row .k {
  color: var(--nf-orange); text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
}
.cover__meta-block .row .v { color: var(--nf-amber-dim); }

.cover__divider {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  padding-top: 8mm;
}
.cover__divider .hr { height: 6px; background: var(--nf-amber-dim); }
.cover__divider .plus {
  color: var(--nf-orange); font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 48pt; line-height: 1; transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.cover__feet {
  margin-top: 8mm;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
}
.cover__feet .f-block .l {
  display: block; color: var(--nf-orange);
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.cover__feet .f-block .v {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.1;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 02 — PARTIES (cream relief)
   FIX: Narrow the giant numeral rail (32mm → 26mm) so body has more room.
        Tighten the recital marker column.
   ===================================================================== */
.relief {
  padding: var(--tune-page-padding);
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--tune-numeral-gap);
}
.relief__num {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 900; font-size: var(--tune-relief-num); line-height: 0.85;
  color: var(--nf-near-black); letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 14px;
}
.relief__num small {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--nf-orange);
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  align-self: baseline;
  position: relative;
  top: -0.4em; /* nudge up so it aligns near the cap of the numeral */
}
.relief__body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--tune-block-gap); flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; }
.relief__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-section-h); line-height: 0.9;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.018em;
}
.relief__lede {
  font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 160mm;
  color: #3D3E3D;
}

.parties {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--nf-near-black);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--nf-near-black);
}
.party {
  padding: 9mm 8mm 9mm 0;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--nf-near-black);
}
.party + .party { padding-left: 8mm; padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }
.party .role {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange); margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.party .name {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 15pt; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.party .meta {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.7;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #3D3E3D;
}
.party .meta b {
  color: var(--nf-near-black); font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.party .meta .row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24mm 1fr; gap: 8px; /* FIX: was 26mm */
  padding: 4px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(42,43,42,0.18);
}
.party .meta .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

/* Recital block */
/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 03 — TERMS (legal, restrained, dark)
   FIX: Added clause grouping (operative · commercial · governance)
        with a thin divider rule between groups so 12 clauses don't
        read as undifferentiated wallpaper.
   ===================================================================== */
.terms {
  padding: var(--tune-page-padding);
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
}
.terms__head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: end;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nf-rule-dark); padding-bottom: 6mm;
  margin-bottom: 8mm;
}
.terms__head .h {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 30pt; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.terms__head .h em { font-style: normal; color: var(--nf-orange); }
.terms__head .meta {
  text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim); opacity: 0.65;
}
.terms__head .meta b { color: var(--nf-orange); opacity: 1; }

/* NEW: clause group with sub-header */
.clause-group {
  margin-bottom: 4mm;
}
.clause-group:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.clause-group__head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
  align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 3mm;
}
.clause-group__head .tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange);
  border: 1px solid var(--nf-orange);
  padding: 3px 8px;
}
.clause-group__head .rule {
  height: 1px; background: var(--nf-rule-dark);
}

.clauses {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  column-gap: 10mm;
  row-gap: var(--tune-clause-row-gap);
  font-size: var(--tune-clause-size);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.clause__num {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  color: var(--nf-orange); margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.clause__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-clause-title); letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
  margin-bottom: 3px;
}
.clause__title .pl { color: var(--nf-orange); }
.clause p { color: rgba(255,232,195,0.85); margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: var(--tune-clause-size); }
.clause p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 04 — SCHEDULE A: PRICING (cream relief)
   FIX: Rebalanced lots-table column widths so "Arakan Mountains"
        doesn't wrap and the price column isn't oversized.
        Old: 18 36 32 22 22 1fr  → New: 16 44 34 18 16 24
   ===================================================================== */
.schedule__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-section-h); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.schedule__sub {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange); margin-top: 6px;
}

.lots {
  margin-top: 10mm;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--nf-near-black);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--nf-near-black);
}
.lots__head, .lots__row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 18mm 1fr 38mm 18mm 24mm; /* 5-col: id / item-desc (flex) / origin-or-term / qty-or-unit / price */
  align-items: stretch;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.lots__row--4col, .lots__head--4col { grid-template-columns: 1fr 38mm 18mm 24mm; }
.lots__row--2col, .lots__head--2col { grid-template-columns: 30mm 1fr; }
.lots__head {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nf-near-black);
}
.lots__head > div {
  padding: 6px 8px 6px 0;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--nf-orange);
}
.lots__row > div {
  padding: var(--tune-lots-row-pad) 8px var(--tune-lots-row-pad) 0;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(42,43,42,0.20);
  font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--nf-near-black);
}
.lots__row:last-child > div { border-bottom: 0; }
.lots__row .lot {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-lots-lot-size); letter-spacing: -0.01em; padding-top: 6px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.lots__row .origin {
  font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.10em; /* FIX: was 0.12em — slight tighten so "ARAKAN MOUNTAINS" fits comfortably */
  font-size: 8pt;
}
.lots__row .gps    { color: #3D3E3D; }
.lots__row .price {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 6px;
  text-align: right; letter-spacing: -0.005em;
}

.totals {
  margin-top: 8mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: end;
  gap: 24px;
}
.totals .note {
  font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #3D3E3D; max-width: 90mm;
}
.totals .grand {
  text-align: right;
}
.totals .grand .l {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange);
}
.totals .grand .v {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 36pt; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.payment-band {
  margin-top: 12mm;
  background: var(--nf-near-black);
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
  padding: 8mm 10mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 0;
}
.payment-band--two { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
.payment-band .cell { padding: 0 8mm; border-left: 1px solid var(--nf-rule-dark); }
.payment-band .cell:first-child { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; }
.payment-band .cell .l {
  display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.payment-band .cell .v {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 22pt; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.payment-band .cell small {
  display: block; margin-top: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: rgba(255,232,195,0.7);
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 05 — IMPACT (aggressive again)
   FIX: Removed the "the line" strike-through gimmick — it was loud and
        not adding meaning. The 10% headline now reads cleanly.
        Caption sits on the image, not floating awkwardly off the bottom.
        Pledge + partners grid rebalanced 1.3 → 1.5 to stop partners
        column from looking cramped.
   ===================================================================== */
.impact {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto;
}
.impact__top {
  padding: 8mm 14mm 8mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  align-items: end; gap: 24px;
}
.impact__top .h {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-impact-h); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
  max-width: 130mm;
}
.impact__top .h em { font-style: normal; color: var(--nf-orange); }
.impact__top .h .strike { display: inline-block; position: relative; }
.impact__top .h .strike::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; left: -2%; right: -2%; top: 48%;
  height: 5px; background: var(--nf-orange);
}
.impact__top .num {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 60pt; line-height: 0.85; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--nf-orange); white-space: nowrap;
}

.impact__map {
  position: relative; padding: 0 14mm;
  margin-top: 4mm;
}
.impact__map img {
  width: 100%; height: 100mm; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center;
  display: block;
}
/* FIX: caption now sits IN the image (bottom-left overlay), not floating below */
.impact__map .caption {
  position: absolute; left: 14mm; bottom: 0;
  display: inline-flex; gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange);
  background: var(--nf-near-black); padding: 6px 10px;
}

.impact__stats {
  padding: 14mm 14mm 6mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--nf-rule-dark);
}
.impact__stats .s {
  padding: 0 6mm; border-left: 1px solid var(--nf-rule-dark);
}
.impact__stats .s:first-child { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; }
.impact__stats .s .l {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.impact__stats .s .v {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: var(--tune-stats-num); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.impact__stats .s .u {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,232,195,0.65); margin-top: 4px;
}

.impact__pledge {
  padding: 6mm 14mm 22mm;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--nf-rule-dark);
  margin-top: 8mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; /* FIX: was 1.4 1 — partners column was cramped */
  gap: 12mm; align-items: start;
}
.impact__pledge p {
  font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255,232,195,0.85);
}
.impact__pledge .partners {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5mm 8mm;
}
.impact__pledge .partners .p {
  border-top: 2px solid var(--nf-orange); padding-top: 6px;
}
.impact__pledge .partners .p .n {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.impact__pledge .partners .p .r {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange); margin-top: 3px;
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 06 — SCHEDULE C · OPERATIONAL ANNEX
   Reuses .relief shell. Adds a structured 4-block layout:
   C.1 Installation · C.2 Callout · C.3 Response.
   ===================================================================== */
.annex {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  gap: 5mm;
}
.annex__group {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--nf-near-black);
  padding-top: 4mm;
}
.annex__group:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--nf-near-black); padding-top: 5mm; }
.annex__head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 12mm 1fr;
  align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 3mm;
}
.annex__tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange); font-weight: 600;
}
.annex__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-near-black);
}
.annex__body {
  padding-left: 12mm;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--nf-near-black);
}
.annex__body p { margin-bottom: 5px; }
.annex__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.annex__body ul {
  list-style: none; padding: 0;
  margin: 4px 0 6px;
}
.annex__body li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 3px;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
}
.annex__body li::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2.5px;
  width: 8px; height: 9px;
  background: url("data:image/svg+xml;base64,") no-repeat center / contain;
}
.annex__note {
  margin-top: 4mm;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--nf-orange);
  background: rgba(255,113,34,0.06);
  font-size: 8.5pt;
  color: #3D3E3D;
  line-height: 1.45;
}
.annex__rates {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8mm;
  margin: 4mm 0 2mm;
  padding: 4mm 0;
  border-top: 1px dashed rgba(42,43,42,0.3);
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(42,43,42,0.3);
}
.annex__rate-l {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.annex__rate-v {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  color: var(--nf-near-black);
}
.annex__rate-v small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 4px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  color: #3D3E3D;
  text-transform: none;
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAGE 06 — SIGNATURES (quiet, cream)
   FIX: Stamp now anchored to a left-aligned block with the doc-id
        meta beside it (was floating with weird gap). Big "+" at right
        rebalanced to match stamp height.
   ===================================================================== */
.sig {
  padding: var(--tune-page-padding);
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
}
.sig__head {
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,43,42,0.4);
  padding-bottom: 6mm; margin-bottom: 14mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  align-items: end; gap: 24px;
}
.sig__head .h {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 36pt; line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.sig__head .meta {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: right; color: #3D3E3D;
}
.sig__head .meta b { color: var(--nf-orange); }

.sig__intro {
  font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D3E3D;
  max-width: 140mm; margin-bottom: 16mm;
}

.sig__blocks {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14mm;
  margin-bottom: 14mm;
}
.sig__block .role {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-orange); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.sig__block .name {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 16pt; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18mm;
}
.sig__line {
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--nf-near-black);
  padding-top: 16mm;
  position: relative;
}
.sig__line .lab {
  position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: -16px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3D3E3D;
}
.sig__row {
  margin-top: 16mm;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12mm;
}
.sig__row .field {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,43,42,0.4);
  padding-bottom: 6px; min-height: 28mm; justify-content: flex-start;
}
.sig__row .field .l {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nf-orange);
}

.sig__witness {
  margin-top: auto; padding-top: 10mm;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(42,43,42,0.4);
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14mm;
}
.sig__witness .row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 26mm 1fr; gap: 10px;
  padding: 6px 0;
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(42,43,42,0.25);
}
.sig__witness .row .k {
  color: var(--nf-orange); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  font-size: 7.5pt; padding-top: 2px;
}

.sig__footer {
  margin-top: 14mm; padding-top: 8mm;
  border-top: 6px solid var(--nf-near-black);
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
}
.sig__footer .stamp {
  width: 22mm; height: 22mm;
  background: var(--nf-stamp-red);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  color: var(--nf-amber-dim);
}
.sig__footer .stamp img { width: 70%; }
.sig__footer .meta {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7.5pt;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--nf-near-black); line-height: 1.7;
}
.sig__footer .meta b { color: var(--nf-orange); }
.sig__footer .pl {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
  font-size: 56pt; line-height: 1; color: var(--nf-orange);
}

/* =====================================================================
   Print
   ===================================================================== */
@media print {
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  html, body { background: #FFF; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    margin: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    page-break-after: always;
    break-after: page;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; break-after: auto; }
}

/* Screen-only: subtle drop shadow so pages float on the dark backdrop. */
@media screen {
  .page {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04), 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
}


/* NoFilter proprietary "+" mark — replaces plain typographic pluses */
.nf-plus { display:inline-block; width:auto; fill:currentColor; }
.cover__divider .plus { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
.cover__divider .plus .nf-plus { height:34pt; }
.relief__num .nf-plus { height:0.78em; align-self:center; }
</style>
<style>
/* =====================================================================
   FILLABLE FIELDS — signature page form fields. Always editable so
   anyone can click and type without first toggling an edit mode.
   Empty fields show a placeholder hint; filled fields display normally.
   Visual cue: subtle dotted underline becomes solid orange on focus.
   In print/PDF, placeholders disappear and underlines render clean.
   ===================================================================== */
.fillable {
  display: inline-block;
  min-width: 60%;
  outline: none;
  cursor: text;
  border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(42,43,42,0.35);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
  transition: border-color 120ms;
}
.fillable:focus {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nf-orange);
  background: rgba(255,113,34,0.04);
}
.fillable:empty::before {
  content: attr(data-placeholder);
  color: rgba(42,43,42,0.30);
  font-style: italic;
}
/* Per-field typography (matches original inline styles) */
.fillable[data-style="name"] {
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em; font-size: 11pt;
}
.fillable[data-style="title"] {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.fillable[data-style="meta"] {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.fillable[data-style="place"] {
  font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
@media print {
  .fillable:empty::before { content: "" !important; }
  .fillable { background: transparent !important; border-bottom: none !important; }
  /* Hide editor UI in print/PDF */
  #nf-editor-toolbar, #nf-export-overlay { display: none !important; }
  [contenteditable="true"]:hover, [contenteditable="true"]:focus {
    outline: none !important;
    background: transparent !important;
  }
}
</style></head>
<body id="artifacts-component-root-html">
<!-- ===== EDITOR TOOLBAR (screen-only, hidden in print) ===== -->
<!-- ===== FULL-PAGE EXPORT FALLBACK OVERLAY (hidden by default) ===== -->
<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 01 — COVER
     ===================================================================== -->
<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 01 — COVER
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="page page--dark page--cover" data-screen-label="01 Cover">
<div class="cover__bg">
<img alt="" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/>
</div>
<div class="cover">
<div class="cover__head">
<div class="stamp"><span class="dot"></span><span>[[PREMISES_CITY_UC]] · WORKPLACE PROGRAMME</span></div>
<div class="stamp"><span>DRAFT · FOR REVIEW</span></div>
</div>
<div class="cover__logo">
<img alt="NOFIL+ER" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"/>
</div>
<div class="cover__sub">
<h1 class="cover__title">[[TARGET_NAME]]'s<br/>WORKPLACE<br/>COFFEE programme<br/><em>[[PROGRAMME_YEARS]]</em></h1>
<div class="cover__meta-block">
<div class="row"><span class="k">Customer</span><span class="v">[[TARGET_LEGAL_ENTITY]]</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="k">Supplier</span><span class="v">NoFilter Pte. Ltd.</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="k">Equipment</span><span class="v" id="ct-equip-summary">[[EQUIPMENT_SUMMARY]]</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="k">Term</span><span class="v" id="ct-term-range">[[TERM_START]] — [[TERM_END]]</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="cover__divider">
<div class="hr"></div>
<div class="plus"><svg class="nf-plus" viewBox="150 110 720 815" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="NoFilter"><path d="M 420.00 140.99 C 469.95 140.96 520.08 140.88 570.02 140.99 C 571.47 141.07 572.74 141.06 573.80 142.19 C 574.64 146.00 574.35 150.11 574.52 154.00 C 575.00 168.66 574.86 183.35 574.26 198.00 C 574.11 212.54 571.47 227.17 567.06 241.01 C 565.30 247.16 562.33 253.66 561.79 260.00 C 561.55 264.05 561.97 268.18 562.77 272.15 C 564.88 281.91 567.07 291.64 569.67 301.28 C 572.40 310.07 574.58 319.02 577.29 327.83 C 580.38 336.99 579.51 347.26 576.36 356.29 C 570.14 375.05 563.87 393.86 557.56 412.60 C 551.26 431.08 545.28 449.88 538.02 467.99 C 537.21 470.26 537.00 472.61 536.99 475.00 C 536.98 484.67 537.04 494.33 536.97 504.00 C 537.00 505.84 536.94 507.56 537.73 509.27 C 545.91 527.44 552.36 546.70 559.69 565.29 C 566.68 583.57 573.81 601.83 580.86 620.09 C 585.31 632.44 585.02 644.18 586.68 657.01 C 588.16 674.02 590.24 690.96 591.55 707.99 C 592.51 714.50 591.52 720.74 590.47 727.17 C 589.09 735.43 588.17 743.74 586.93 752.03 C 585.55 761.22 583.98 770.72 583.30 780.00 C 583.57 790.04 585.34 800.16 586.53 810.13 C 589.43 836.44 592.48 862.65 594.98 889.00 C 595.05 890.89 595.36 892.45 593.73 893.79 C 590.21 894.29 586.55 894.02 583.00 894.05 C 559.33 894.11 535.66 894.11 512.00 894.70 C 487.66 895.20 463.34 894.94 439.00 895.10 C 437.02 894.95 433.79 895.35 432.35 893.73 C 430.66 889.19 431.14 883.82 430.36 879.00 C 428.89 857.31 426.82 835.65 424.94 813.99 C 424.42 804.13 422.11 793.81 423.24 784.01 C 427.32 757.42 431.25 730.84 435.39 704.26 C 435.97 700.65 437.19 697.66 436.22 694.00 C 432.05 674.95 427.16 656.03 422.89 637.00 C 419.78 624.69 417.25 612.27 413.96 600.01 C 339.95 599.92 266.01 600.27 192.00 599.21 C 189.29 599.13 186.92 598.97 185.75 596.16 C 184.03 591.13 184.12 585.27 183.52 580.01 C 182.82 574.00 183.03 568.03 182.79 562.00 C 182.37 550.67 182.07 539.34 182.00 528.00 C 181.99 494.00 182.00 460.00 182.00 426.00 C 182.09 421.34 182.12 416.58 182.89 411.97 C 183.04 409.77 184.92 408.29 186.96 407.88 C 191.23 407.19 195.70 407.45 200.01 407.35 C 270.34 407.15 340.67 407.57 411.00 407.08 C 410.78 369.38 410.66 331.70 411.09 294.00 C 411.39 286.99 412.10 280.03 411.99 273.00 C 411.78 263.63 413.12 254.37 412.97 245.00 C 412.92 224.33 413.44 203.67 413.74 183.00 C 413.94 169.40 413.51 155.74 414.13 142.15 C 416.11 141.27 417.83 140.97 420.00 140.99 Z" fill="currentColor" /><path d="M 596.78 384.16 C 599.85 385.29 600.56 388.47 601.79 391.16 C 604.09 396.58 605.88 402.26 608.54 407.52 C 621.67 407.01 634.86 407.35 648.00 407.28 C 705.67 407.41 763.34 407.33 821.00 407.64 C 827.00 407.90 832.26 407.06 837.96 409.04 C 838.55 411.00 839.10 412.93 839.10 415.00 C 839.31 426.66 839.19 438.32 839.23 450.00 C 839.23 496.00 839.30 542.00 839.11 588.00 C 839.03 590.92 839.26 594.34 838.19 597.09 C 837.51 598.88 836.02 600.15 834.03 600.01 C 811.47 600.23 788.56 600.26 766.00 600.31 C 713.33 600.18 660.66 600.48 608.00 600.09 C 606.44 600.05 604.82 600.08 603.28 599.80 C 601.72 598.80 601.05 597.30 600.34 595.68 C 597.92 589.75 595.30 583.92 593.05 577.92 C 587.10 562.46 580.36 547.35 573.89 532.11 C 571.74 527.33 569.14 522.70 567.24 517.82 C 565.35 513.24 566.17 508.06 565.79 503.00 C 565.09 493.92 565.07 484.94 563.18 475.99 C 562.21 471.28 562.41 467.58 564.11 463.08 C 573.30 437.61 582.69 412.45 592.10 387.09 C 592.84 385.21 594.58 383.26 596.78 384.16 Z" fill="currentColor" /></svg></div>
<div class="hr"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rail rail--bottom">
<div class="rail__group"><span>NOFILTER · A CONSERVATION-LED COFFEE COMPANY</span></div>
<div class="rail__group"><span class="orange">PAGE</span><span>01 / 09</span></div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 02 — PARTIES (cream relief)
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="page page--cream" data-screen-label="02 Parties">
<div class="rail rail--top">
<div class="rail__group">
<span class="orange">SECTION</span>
<span>01 · THE PARTIES</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relief">
<div class="relief__num">01<small>SECTION</small></div>
<div class="relief__body">
<h2 class="relief__title">[[TARGET_NAME]]'s workplace<br/>coffee programme.<br/></h2>
<p class="relief__lede">
        This agreement is entered into between the parties named below. It governs the supply of one (1) commercial coffee machine,
        scheduled servicing, and an open consumables menu, for a term of <span class="ct-term-months">[[TERM_MONTHS]]</span> months from <b class="ct-term-start">[[TERM_START]]</b> to <b class="ct-term-end">[[TERM_END]]</b> at the Customer's premises in [[PREMISES_CITY]].
      </p>
<div class="parties">
<div class="party">
<div class="role">Supplier · 01</div>
<div class="name">NoFilter Pte. Ltd.</div>
<div class="meta">
<div class="row"><b>UEN</b><span>201839882N</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>office</b><span>31 Kaki Bukit Road 3, #01-02C, Techlink, Singapore 417818</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>Signed by</b><span>Alex Clark</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>Contact</b><span>[[NF_CONTACT_EMAIL]]</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="party">
<div class="role">Customer · 02</div>
<div class="name">[[TARGET_LEGAL_ENTITY]]</div>
<div class="meta">
<div class="row"><b>UEN</b><span>[[TARGET_UEN]]</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>office</b><span>[[TARGET_OFFICE]]</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>Signed by</b><span>[[TARGET_SIGNATORY]]</span></div>
<div class="row"><b>Contact</b><span>[[TARGET_CONTACT_EMAIL]]</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rail rail--bottom">
<div class="rail__group"><span>WORKPLACE COFFEE AGREEMENT</span></div>
<div class="rail__group"><span class="orange">PAGE</span><span>02 / 09</span></div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 03 — TERMS
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="page page--dark grain" data-screen-label="03 Terms">
<div class="rail rail--top">
<div class="rail__group">
<span class="orange">SECTION</span>
<span>02 · TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="terms">
<div class="terms__head">
<div class="h">contract <em>terms</em></div>
<div class="meta">CL. 01 — CL. 08<br/><b>BINDING</b> · GOVERNED BY THE LAWS OF [[GOVERNING_JURISDICTION_UC]]</div>
</div>
<div class="clause-group">
<div class="clause-group__head">
<span class="tag">operative · 01—04</span>
<span class="rule"></span>
</div>
<div class="clauses">
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 01</div>
<div class="clause__title">Equipment Supply</div>
<p>The Supplier supplies one (1) CaféMatic 5 commercial coffee machine and one (1) compatible milk cooler, as itemised in <b>Schedule A</b>, on a rental basis. The equipment remains the property of the Supplier (or its financing partner under <b>Cl. 10</b>) for the term.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 02</div>
<div class="clause__title">Installation</div>
<p>The Supplier installs and commissions the equipment at the Customer's site on a pre-agreed date with all pre-installation requirements confirmed completed.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 03</div>
<div class="clause__title">Service &amp; Maintenance</div>
<p>The Supplier provides bi-annual preventative maintenance and calibration as part of this rental agreement, and bears the cost of all spare parts changes, save where the fault is caused by Customer negligence. The Customer shall purchase and apply daily cleaning materials at its own cost. Response time for callouts: twenty-four (24) hours.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 04</div>
<div class="clause__title">Consumables Supply</div>
<p>The Supplier supplies coffee beans, cocoa powder, and other consumables on demand, drawn from the menu in <b>Schedule B</b>. The Customer may add or remove items from the menu by written notice; pricing is per <b>Schedule B</b>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="clause-group">
<div class="clause-group__head">
<span class="tag">commercial · 05—08</span>
<span class="rule"></span>
</div>
<div class="clauses">
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 05</div>
<div class="clause__title">Conservation Contribution</div>
<p>For each kilogram of conservation coffee purchased <b>and paid for</b> by the Customer, the Supplier contributes a percentage of the purchase value to its NGO conservation partners (identified in <b>Schedule D</b>). The applicable rate is set by the agreed coffee price in <b>Schedule D</b>: five percent (5%) where the price is below [[CURRENCY]] [[RATE_THRESHOLD]]/kg, and ten percent (10%) at or above [[CURRENCY]] [[RATE_THRESHOLD]]/kg. Where the Customer elects a voluntary co-contribution (&ldquo;Top-Up&rdquo;), that amount is passed to the NGO partners in full, in addition to the percentage. Contributions are calculated on volume purchased and paid for, reconciled quarterly (31 March, 30 June, 30 September, 31 December), and paid to the NGO partners within sixty (60) days of each reconciliation date.<span class="ct-cons-elected" style="display:none;"> Based on the agreed coffee price, the applicable conservation rate is <b class="ct-cons-rate" id="ct-cons-rate"></b><span class="ct-topup-wrap" style="display:none;">, with a voluntary Top-Up of <b class="ct-topup" id="ct-topup"></b>/kg</span>.</span></p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 06</div>
<div class="clause__title">Pricing</div>
<p>Equipment rental is fixed at the rate set in <b>Schedule A</b> for the term. Consumables are fixed at the rates in <b>Schedule B</b> for the first twelve (12) months from <b class="ct-term-start">[[TERM_START]]</b>, then reviewed annually with thirty (30) days' written notice.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 07</div>
<div class="clause__title">Order Process</div>
<p>Consumables orders are placed by email or messaging to the Supplier contact named in this agreement. Coffee orders are fulfilled within five (5) business days assuming that orders are placed prior to the Monday 1200 weekly deadline.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 08</div>
<div class="clause__title">Payment</div>
<p>Equipment rental is invoiced monthly in advance by <b>[[FINANCE_PARTNER]]</b> (the financing partner under <b>Cl. 10</b>). Consumables are invoiced in arrears by the Supplier. Payment terms: Net 30 days.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rail rail--bottom">
<div class="rail__group"><span>WORKPLACE COFFEE AGREEMENT</span></div>
<div class="rail__group"><span class="orange">PAGE</span><span>03 / 10</span></div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 04 — TERMS (cont.) · GOVERNANCE (CL 09—12)
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="page page--dark grain" data-screen-label="04 Terms cont.">
<div class="rail rail--top">
<div class="rail__group">
<span class="orange">SECTION</span>
<span>02 · TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS · CONT.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="terms">
<div class="terms__head">
<div class="h">contract <em>terms</em> <span style="opacity:.45;">/ 2.</span></div>
<div class="meta">CL. 09 — CL. 14<br/><b>BINDING</b> · GOVERNED BY THE LAWS OF [[GOVERNING_JURISDICTION_UC]]</div>
</div>
<div class="clause-group">
<div class="clause-group__head">
<span class="tag">commercial · 09</span>
<span class="rule"></span>
</div>
<div class="clauses">
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 09</div>
<div class="clause__title">Term &amp; Renewal</div>
<p>The term is <span class="ct-term-months">[[TERM_MONTHS]]</span> months, running from <b class="ct-term-start">[[TERM_START]]</b> to <b class="ct-term-end">[[TERM_END]]</b>. Renewal is by mutual written agreement no later than sixty (60) days before expiry. In the absence of agreement, the equipment is collected by the Supplier within ten (10) business days of contract expiry.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="clause-group">
<div class="clause-group__head">
<span class="tag">governance · 10—14</span>
<span class="rule"></span>
</div>
<div class="clauses">
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 10</div>
<div class="clause__title">Financing Partner</div>
<p>The equipment rental component is financed through <b>[[FINANCE_PARTNER]]</b>. The Customer pays [[FINANCE_PARTNER]] directly for equipment rental and may need to onboard [[FINANCE_PARTNER]] as a payee in its accounts payable system. The Supplier remains the Customer's sole point of contact and is operationally and legally responsible for all matters relating to the equipment, service, coffee quality, and consumables.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 11</div>
<div class="clause__title">Title &amp; Risk</div>
<p>Title to the equipment remains with the Supplier or [[FINANCE_PARTNER]] throughout the term. The Supplier bears risk of loss or damage to the equipment in normal use. Damage from misuse or negligence is for the Customer's account at cost.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 12</div>
<div class="clause__title">Termination</div>
<p>Either party may terminate for material breach not cured within thirty (30) days of written notice. The Supplier may also terminate on non-payment exceeding sixty (60) days. On termination, the Customer permits collection of equipment within ten (10) business days.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 13</div>
<div class="clause__title">Governing Law</div>
<p>This agreement is governed by the laws of [[GOVERNING_JURISDICTION]]. The [[GOVERNING_JURISDICTION]] courts have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising under it.</p>
</div>
<div class="clause">
<div class="clause__num">CL. 14</div>
<div class="clause__title">[[TAX_LABEL]]</div>
<p>All amounts payable under this agreement, including those set out in <b>Schedule A</b> and <b>Schedule B</b>, are exclusive of [[TAX_LABEL_LONG]]. [[TAX_LABEL]] will be added to invoices at the prevailing rate.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rail rail--bottom">
<div class="rail__group"><span>WORKPLACE COFFEE AGREEMENT</span></div>
<div class="rail__group"><span class="orange">PAGE</span><span>04 / 09</span></div>
</div>
</section>
