<!-- =====================================================================
     PAGE 06 — SCHEDULE C · OPERATIONAL ANNEX (cream relief)
     Pulled from prior contract: installation specs, servicing schedule,
     callout fees, response time. Binding alongside Schedules A & B.
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="page page--cream" data-screen-label="07 Schedule C">
<div class="rail rail--top">
<div class="rail__group">
<span class="orange">SCHEDULE C</span>
<span>OPERATIONAL ANNEX</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relief">
<div class="relief__num">C<small>SCHEDULE</small></div>
<div class="relief__body">
<h2 class="schedule__title">Installation,<br/>servicing, and<br/>response.</h2>
<div class="schedule__sub">BINDING · OPERATIONAL DETAIL FOR CL. 02 &amp; CL. 03</div>
<div class="annex">
<div class="annex__group">
<div class="annex__head">
<span class="annex__tag">C.1</span>
<span class="annex__title">Installation requirements</span>
</div>
<div class="annex__body">
<p>The Customer shall provide the following utilities at the install location, within one (1) metre of the machine:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Power</b> — single phase supply (1P/N/E, 230V, 13A) with circuit breaker</li>
<li><b>Water</b> — fixed supply, minimum 2 bar pressure, ½" thread stop cock <i>(If fixed water input).</i></li>
<li><b>Drainage</b> — 50 DN, with sufficient gradient <i>(If fixed water input and output).</i></li>
</ul>
<p class="annex__note">The Supplier installs the machine free of charge and does not perform carpentry, plumbing, or electrical works.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="annex__group">
<div class="annex__head">
<span class="annex__tag">C.2</span>
<span class="annex__title">Out-of-hours callout</span>
</div>
<div class="annex__body">
<p>Callouts requested outside the pre-arranged quarterly schedule are charged at the prevailing rates:</p>
<div class="annex__rates">
<div class="annex__rate">
<div class="annex__rate-l">Mon–Fri, working hours</div>
<div class="annex__rate-v">[[CURRENCY]] 150.00<small>plus [[CURRENCY]] 50/hr labour thereafter</small></div>
</div>
<div class="annex__rate">
<div class="annex__rate-l">After hours / weekends / PH</div>
<div class="annex__rate-v">[[CURRENCY]] 200.00<small>plus [[CURRENCY]] 40/hr labour thereafter</small></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="annex__note">Callouts caused by Customer mishandling, failure to clean, or damage attributable to the Customer are charged at the rates above plus parts at cost.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="annex__group">
<div class="annex__head">
<span class="annex__tag">C.3</span>
<span class="annex__title">Response time</span>
</div>
<div class="annex__body">
<p>The Supplier shall endeavour to rectify reported faults within twenty-four (24) hours of the request. Where a machine is not fixable on-site, the Supplier shall provide a replacement machine of equivalent capacity by the next working day following the failure date.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rail rail--bottom">
<div class="rail__group"><span>WORKPLACE COFFEE AGREEMENT</span></div>
<div class="rail__group"><span class="orange">PAGE</span><span>07 / 09</span></div>
</div>
</section>
